## Input

```css
@mixin font-options {
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  @include font-options;
  @if true { font-weight: 400; }
  font-family: Example;
  src: url(example.woff2);
}

@keyframes fade {
  from {
    @include fade-start;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  50% {
    @if $bounce { transform: scale(1.1); } @else { transform: none; }
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  to {
    $end: 1;
    opacity: $end;
    @each $prop in $props { #{$prop}: none; }
  }
}

```


